    "detailed_description": "Violent Selection takes place on a fictional world where the T.R.A.U.M.A. Research Center for New Social Behaviour Studies is developing the Unnatural Selection Case Study #9, with Mr. Venturi as the subject. The setting is a condominium, where Mr. Venturi must survive seven levels packed with enemies in order to succeed. Will he be able to do it? Or is he going to reach for more?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nViolent Selection is primarily a story-driven, bloody and violent top-down shooter. Below you can find the main features of the game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt;Main features:<br />\r\n- Seven levels in a condominium setting - free space, reception and five floors of apartments;<br />\r\n- Differents types of weapons to choose from, as well as fists;<br />\r\n- Beat 'em up elements;<br />\r\n- Cartoonized gore with excessive blood and brains (pixel style);<br />\r\n- Top-down with 360 degrees movement;<br />\r\n- Stealth elements: crawl to get near the enemy unnoticed and finish him;<br />\r\n- Speedrun timer;<br />\r\n- Speedrun leaderboard.",
